{
 "about": "Official card faces for the grade-check benchmark (bench:grade --faces): digital renders: Pokémon from images.pokemontcg.io, Disney Lorcana from lorcana-api.com, fetched into .cache/grade-data/official/ by scripts/fetch-grade-data.mjs --faces. The images are the publisher's artwork: use them locally for testing only, never commit or ship them. borders: border width per side in mm (the image bounds are the card: 63 x 88 mm, Lorcana 63.5 x 88.9 mm), where the colour is halfway (linear light) between the border and the print just inside it, median over the middle 60 % of the side; only designs with a crisp border end on all four sides (10-90 % rise of 0.26 mm or less) are listed, so XY/BW frames, full arts and SV trainers are left out. The benchmark moves the whole print against the cut by a known amount (a miscut), so the true borders of every case are these plus that shift. Lorcana prints its bottom border about 3.2 mm wider than the top one: such a card is centred, and its truth taken, against that layout.",
